    "message": "A document level charge or tax (BG-21) is categorised \"K\" (intra-community supply), and the invoice carries none of them: a seller VAT identifier (BT-31) or a seller tax representative VAT identifier (BT-63), and a buyer VAT identifier (BT-48).",
